  "arrangerNotes": "Vocal line only (piano part left out), 3/4 time, verified against the Mutopia LilyPond edition (from the Indiana University score). Keeps Brahms' dotted 'Lul-la-by' rhythm and the one-beat rests at the ends of phrases. Two acciaccatura grace notes left out. No accidentals. Range 1 to high 1, minLayout 8 on both drums. C and D arrangements use identical degree sequences (both fit their drums).",
